ecording equipment, and buy new consoles to increase the results of your VODs. You can also hire employees: editors, financiers, or personal trainers <strong>to be more productive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487060/extras/98f73010ff6b4a8561aca57bb7b73f76.avif?t=1752760372\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487060/extras/30a52b83f7c4575c77b9c6edd0c6c898.poster.avif?t=1752760372\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487060/extras/30a52b83f7c4575c77b9c6edd0c6c898.webm?t=1752760372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487060/extras/30a52b83f7c4575c77b9c6edd0c6c898.mp4?t=1752760372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you become a popular star</strong>, the main brands will want you to be their image ambassador. Meet and negotiate with <strong>the most important companies of the moment</strong> and get the best possible conditions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487060/extras/18a5821d472fbd35a054dfcdf319583e.avif?t=1752760372\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487060/extras/a42c1874bb66e617ff6e64be4b03f7ff.poster.avif?t=1752760372\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com